$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Endor" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear with signs of Rain" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Mid-Afternoon" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The Empire and the Rebellion are at it again! This time the Empire has set up a small base on the moon of Endor, that powers the shield generator for the new Death Star. The Rebellion has to seize control of it to shut it down, so the fleet can finish of the Death Star. The Empire on the other hand has to hold on to it no matter how harsh the circumstances are. This battle will decide the outcome of the war. Who will win?                 -XGN Darth Maul  " @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks:<f0> I'd like to thank the whole XGN crew, Bosshog for the map I took this from, Optimizer for lettin me in :)and all of the other members for support. So have fun.";
